+# Redrob CAD
+
+Redrob CAD is a lightweight, native-Qt modernization of FreeCAD with a built-in [Redrob Code](https://console.redrob.ai/code) agent workbench. It deliberately preserves the complete FreeCAD C++/Python runtime, workbench ecosystem, file compatibility, and interactive 3D stack instead of replacing mature CAD behavior with an incomplete rewrite.
+
+- Read the [architecture and Redrob Code integration](docs/redrob-cad-architecture.md).
+- Review the [side-by-side FreeCAD ↔ Redrob CAD feature parity audit](docs/feature-parity.md).
+- The new Redrob CAD appearance uses native Qt/QSS—no Electron, Chromium, or web runtime.
+- Install and authenticate Redrob Code separately, then select the **Redrob CAD AI** workbench.
+
+> Redrob CAD is based on FreeCAD and retains its LGPL-2.1-or-later license, notices, source history, and contributor attribution. The FreeCAD project information below remains applicable to the inherited CAD platform.
+
